        "notes": "Mature content is entirely restricted to the use of some blood and gore in several \"story missions\". This is a scifi game with some hostile alien creatures and other situations where aliens or humans are injured/killed. \r\n\r\nIn most scenarios, this blood/gore is seen in the aftermath of some event that previously occurred. Active violence does occur in story art panels, but the majority of blood or gore comes from alien creatures, rather than humans. The player character and it's species are not human, and most aliens in the game are also not human.\r\n\r\nAll story missions are skippable, with instant rewards given based on a randomized path taken in the stories. Therefore, it is possible to never see any blood/gore or adult themes when playing Aurora Nova."
